ha  Taparia", "title": "Co-Founder & Joint CEO of Wealth", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sanjay  Wadhwa", "title": "Chief Finance Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 20200000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Santoshi  Kittur", "title": "Chief Technology Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sandeep  Joshi", "title": "Senior Executive Vice President of Legal", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Rohit Shriniwas Bhase", "title": "Company Secretary & Compliance Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 9700000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Anil  Mascarenhas", "title": "Senior Executive Vice President of Communications", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Ronak Ramesh Sheth", "title": "Senior Executive Vice President of Marketing & Client Experience", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Navin  Upadhyaya", "title": "Chief Human Resources Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}], "compensationAsOfEpochDate": 1767139200, "executiveTeam": [], "maxAge": 86400, "priceHint": 2, "previousClose": 1112.4, "open": 1125.4, "dayLow": 1119.1, "dayHigh": 1139.8, "regularMarketPreviousClose": 1112.4, "regularMarketOpen": 1125.4, "regularMarketDayLow": 1119.1, "regularMarketDayHigh": 1139.8, "dividendRate": 18.0, "dividendYield": 1.62, "exDividendDate": 1777248000, "payoutRatio": 0.4111, "fiveYearAvgDividendYield": 2.75, "beta": 0.389, "trailingPE": 39.03912, "forwardPE": 27.33179, "volume": 396486, "regularMarketVolume": 396484, "averageVolume": 1108895, "averageVolume10days": 624820, "averageDailyVolume10Day": 624820, "bid": 1137.6, "ask": 1137.6, "marketCap": 462201454592, 